<figure
  class="not-prose my-10 border-y border-copy/25 py-6"
  aria-labelledby="platform-layers-caption"
>
  <figcaption id="platform-layers-caption" class="mb-5 text-sm text-dim">
    Three layers of the platform — a conceptual overview, not a dependency graph.
  </figcaption>
  <dl class="space-y-5">
    <.platform_layer title="Make the product">
      <a href="https://openpencil.dev">OpenPencil</a>
      and VuePencil: inspect designs, edit components, build interfaces.
    </.platform_layer>
    <.platform_layer title="Guide the work">
      Pi / pi-elixir, Vibe, ExAST, and Reach: give agents a working environment, structural tools, and feedback.
    </.platform_layer>
    <.platform_layer title="Run and observe">
      QuickBEAM, Volt, QuackDB, ReleaseKit, and HostKit: execution, assets, storage, packaging, and deployment.
    </.platform_layer>
  </dl>
  <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-dim">
    Some pieces are usable today; the integrated founder-facing product is still being built.
  </p>
</figure>
